---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy">
    <!-- Privacy Policy Content -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white dark:bg-black">
        <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-0 max-w-4xl">
            <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
            <p
                class="text-lg font-bold text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 mb-12"
            >
                Last Updated: 19th January 2026
            </p>

            <div class="prose prose-lg dark:prose-invert">
                <p>
                    This Privacy Policy describes how We Make Small ("we," "us,"
                    or "our") collects, uses, and discloses your personal
                    information when you visit our website or engage our
                    services. We are committed to protecting your privacy in
                    accordance with the Privacy Act 1988 (Cth) and the
                    Australian Privacy Principles (APPs).
                </p>

                <h3 class="font-bold">1. Information we collect</h3>
                <p>
                    We may collect personal information that you voluntarily
                    provide to us, including:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Contact Data:</strong> Name, email address, phone
                        number, and business name provided via contact forms or email.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Service Data:</strong> Information related to your
                        website project, including login credentials (where provided),
                        brand assets, and content.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Usage Data:</strong> Non-identifiable information
                        about how you use our website (e.g., IP address, browser type)
                        via cookies and analytics tools.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="font-bold">2. How we use your information</h3>
                <p>
                    We use the collected information for the following purposes:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        To provide, operate, and maintain our web design and
                        maintenance services.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        To communicate with you regarding your project,
                        inquiries, or support requests.
                    </li>
                    <li>To process payments and issue invoices.</li>
                    <li>
                        To send occasional marketing communications or referral
                        program updates (you may opt-out at any time).
                    </li>
                    <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="font-bold">3. Disclosure of your information</h3>
                <p>
                    We do not sell or rent your personal information to third
                    parties. We may share your information with:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Service Providers:</strong> Trusted third-party vendors
                        who assist us in operating our business (e.g., hosting providers,
                        accounting software).
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> If required by law, regulation,
                        or legal process.
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <h3 class="font-bold">4. Data security</h3>
                <p>
                    We take reasonable steps to protect your personal
                    information from unauthorized access, loss, or misuse. This
                    includes using secure hosting environments and
                    password-protected systems. However, no method of
                    transmission over the internet is 100% secure.
                </p>

                <h3 class="font-bold">5. Your rights and access</h3>
                <p>
                    Under the Australian Privacy Principles, you have the right
                    to:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Access the personal information we hold about you.</li>
                    <li>
                        Request the correction of inaccurate or out-of-date
                        information.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        Request the deletion of your personal data (subject to
                        legal or contractual record-keeping requirements).
                    </li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    To exercise these rights, please contact us via the details
                    below.
                </p>

                <h3 class="font-bold">6. Third-party links</h3>
                <p>
                    Our website may contain links to other sites. We are not
                    responsible for the privacy practices or content of those
                    third-party websites.
                </p>

                <h3 class="font-bold">7. Changes to this policy</h3>
                <p>
                    We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The
                    updated version will be indicated by a revised "Last
                    Updated" date and will be effective immediately upon
                    posting.
                </p>

                <h3 class="font-bold">Contact us</h3>
                <p>
                    If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy
                    Policy, please contact:
                </p>
                <p>
                    <strong class="font-bold">We Make Small</strong><br />
                    Melbourne, Victoria, Australia<br />
                    Email: <a href="mailto:hello@sitename.com.au"
                        >hello@sitename.com.au</a
                    >
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</MainLayout>
